  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rule of Law Expertise Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve Rule of Law environments in developing countries by matching UK judicial and legal expertise, both private and public sector, with demand in developing countries to improve the policies, organisations and practices of legal and judicial systems. It aims to provide targeted short-term assignments and to build strategic partnerships through  a combination of assignments, additional technical support, and through its evidence and lesson learning work. The Programme will respond to demand for UK legal expertise from all 28 DFID priority countries.</narrative>
  </description>
